          "lib/widgets/glass/sistrum_glass_auto_probe_host.dart",
          "lib/services/shell_navigation_service.dart",
          "lib/services/app_navigation_service.dart"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "lib/services/ has 41 top-level .dart files (8255 LOC) with no subfolder for backup, updates, navigation, or glass, while library/, playback/ and ffmpeg/ are subfolders.",
          "The glass probe and warmup logic is in services/ (sistrum_glass_warmup.dart, sistrum_glass_auto_probe.dart) but its consumers are widgets/glass/sistrum_glass_preparation.dart and widgets/glass/sistrum_glass_auto_probe_host.dart; sistrum_glass_warmup.dart imports widgets/glass/sistrum_chrome.dart and liquid_glass_easy.",
          "services/shell_navigation_service.dart declares the ShellTab enum and static ValueNotifier<Color?> / ValueNotifier<Brightness?> chrome state, while services/app_navigation_service.dart holds only rootNavigatorKey. Two navigation owners sit in the same flat folder."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Move sistrum_glass_warmup.dart and sistrum_glass_auto_probe.dart into lib/widgets/glass/ beside their host and preparation widgets. Move the chrome ValueNotifiers from ShellNavigationService into a single navigation owner (for example lib/navigation/shell_navigation.dart holding both the root key and the tab state) so there is one place for navigation. Do not add new abstraction; this is a file move plus merge.",
        "reasoning": "",
        "summary_hash": "8f381967"
      },
      "status": "fixed",
