        "related_files": [
          "test/local_song_menu_actions_test.dart",
          "test/local_album_cue_delete_test.dart",
          "test/local_track_batch_delete_test.dart",
          "test/sistrum_artwork_contrast_test.dart"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "local_song_menu_actions_test.dart:142-150 loops while DateTime.now() is before a 5 s deadline, calling runAsync(Future.delayed 5 ms) and pump(10 ms) until a condition holds.",
          "local_album_cue_delete_test.dart:211-215 polls library.removedPaths against a 5 s DateTime.now() deadline because a real file deletion finishes on the platform event loop.",
          "local_track_batch_delete_test.dart:102-103 uses the same deadline-loop idiom.",
          "sistrum_artwork_contrast_test.dart:58-62 uses a 3 s DateTime.now() deadline loop."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Move the repeated polling into one shared test helper (for example in test/support/) with a single documented timeout, and replace file-deletion waits with an injectable fake or a Completer that the fake library completes, so the assertion does not depend on real I/O timing.",
