        "related_files": [
          "lib/services/update_checker.dart"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "Doc comment on UpdateCheckException (lines 76-78): 'checkForUpdate returns null only when a verified release list has no newer version'.",
          "checkForUpdate lines 181-184: 'if (!_isAndroid) { return null; }' runs before any fetch or verification and returns null silently.",
          "Every other null return in checkForUpdate is guarded by _throwUnverified() when snapshot.verified is false (lines 195, 212, 233), so the early return is the sole exception."
        ],
