          "queue_tab_helpers.dart:57,67,78,92,112 carry filterQuality as String? into the query request.",
          "duplicate_quality_policy.dart:5 defines enum DuplicateFidelity { lossless, lossy, unknown } for the same lossless/lossy concept."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Introduce an enum for the quality filter (for example LibraryQualityFilter { hires, cd, lossy }) with a single mapping to the native query value, and type the filter fields and request as that enum. Reuse DuplicateFidelity where the concepts overlap. Verify the native value set before changing the mapping.",
